{"id":"28d48ac87f8f834a","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable.md","title":"Hereditarily Ordinal-Definable","display":"df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable — Hereditarily Ordinal-Definable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable","aliases":["58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable","HOD"],"display":"df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable — Hereditarily Ordinal-Definable","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable</span><span>HOD</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable — Hereditarily Ordinal-Definable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6d73b681e650638\" href=\"?note=a6d73b681e650638\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md\">../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span> (集合)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OD},\\operatorname{HOD}\">\\(\\operatorname{OD},\\operatorname{HOD}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HOD}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HOD}_S\\)</span> (序数可定义类、遗传序数可定义类及其逐点谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6d73b681e650638\" href=\"?note=a6d73b681e650638\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md\">../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\nx\\in\\operatorname{HOD}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HOD}_S(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TC}(\\{x\\})\\subseteq\\operatorname{OD}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\nx\\in\\operatorname{HOD}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HOD}_S(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TC}(\\{x\\})\\subseteq\\operatorname{OD}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6d73b681e650638\" href=\"?note=a6d73b681e650638\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md\">../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md</a> 中既有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HOD}_S/\\operatorname{HOD}\">\\(\\mathrm{HOD}_S/\\operatorname{HOD}\\)</span> 定义的兼容入口，不再用相同 theorem label 重复定义全局类。</li>\n<li>HOD: hereditarily ordinal-definable sets; captures definable inner model</li>\n<li>HOD 是 ZFC 的传递真类内模型，这是定义后的定理。</li>\n<li>若每个集合都序数可定义，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\operatorname{HOD}\">\\(V=\\operatorname{HOD}\\)</span>；这不推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HOD}=L\">\\(\\operatorname{HOD}=L\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Core model induction: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HOD}^V\">\\(\\operatorname{HOD}^V\\)</span> key in inner model theory; compares with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span></li>\n<li>HOD 中的组合性质需相对于 HOD 解释，不能无条件声称它包含所有 Suslin 树。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory</li>\n<li>Steel, The Core Model Iterability Problem</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md","status":"resolved","id":"a6d73b681e650638","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md","status":"resolved","id":"a6d73b681e650638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OD},\\operatorname{HOD}$ and $\\mathrm{HOD}_S$ (序数可定义类、遗传序数可定义类及其逐点谓词, see [[../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md","status":"resolved","id":"a6d73b681e650638","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本文件是 [[../batch16/58-df-ordinal-definable.md]] 中既有 $\\mathrm{HOD}_S/\\operatorname{HOD}$ 定义的兼容入口，不再用相同 theorem label 重复定义全局类。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OD},\\operatorname{HOD}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HOD}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hereditarily\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\nx\\in\\operatorname{HOD}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HOD}_S(x)\n\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TC}(\\{x\\})\\subseteq\\operatorname{OD}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HOD}_S/\\operatorname{HOD}","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\operatorname{HOD}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HOD}=L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HOD}^V","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":1563,"backlinks":[{"id":"e9a3aa5f1d968e98","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{HOD}$ (hereditarily ordinal-definable universe, see [[58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable]])"},{"id":"b8fb0c5932791f94","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{HOD}$ (hereditarily ordinal-definable inner class, see [[../batch06/58-df-hereditarily-ordinal-definable.md]])"},{"id":"84daad54487